// ROUND 65 -- THE VOLLEY TEMPLATE WAS CAST INTO NOTHING.
//
// `ranged_volley` generates abilities with `template: 'volley'`, the generator
// gives them volleyCount and volleySpread, the description promises "Looses N
// bolts of fire at once, spread apart", the stats line prints "3 bolts, 14 dmg
// each" -- and _castKnownAbility's dispatch chain tested only
// `template === 'projectileBall'`, so casting one burned its cooldown and
// produced no bolt, no damage and no effect at all. FIVE of the twenty marquee
// confluences route through this category, the Dragon's Firestorm and the
// Manticore's Quill Volley among them.
//
// The multi-bolt spread itself was never missing: the projectileBall branch has
// read volleyCount and volleySpread since round 44. Only the door was shut.
const PROJECTILE_TEMPLATES = new Set(['projectileBall', 'volley']);
const isProjectileTemplate = (t) => PROJECTILE_TEMPLATES.has(t);

